      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ah, the land of the rustling of wings, which is beyond the rivers of Ethiopia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that sendeth ambassadors by the sea, even in vessels of papyrus upon the waters, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", Go, ye swift messengers, to a nation tall and smooth, to a people terrible from their beginning onward, a nation that meteth out and treadeth down, whose land the rivers divide! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All ye inhabitants of the world, and ye dwellers on the earth, when an ensign is lifted up on the mountains, see ye; and when the trumpet is blown, hear ye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thus hath Jehovah said unto me, I will be still, and I will behold in my dwelling-place, like clear heat in sunshine, like a cloud of dew in the heat of harvest. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For before the harvest, when the blossom is over, and the flower becometh a ripening grape, he will cut off the sprigs with pruning-hooks, and the spreading branches will he take away ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " cut down. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall be left together unto the ravenous birds of the mountains, and to the beasts of the earth; and the ravenous birds shall summer upon them, and all the beasts of the earth shall winter upon them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In that time shall a present be brought unto Jehovah of hosts ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " a people tall and smooth, even from a people terrible from their beginning onward, a nation that meteth out and treadeth down, whose land the rivers divide, to the place of the name of Jehovah of hosts, the mount Zion.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
